{"id":"n77807-1-10","stage":2,"title":"지퍼 · 拉链","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77807-1-10-1","ko":"추우니까 지퍼를 잠그는 게 어때?","zh":"天气这么冷，把拉链拉上怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"추우니까","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추우니까","audio":"/audio/51c3e290177ec4552ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"지퍼를","meaning":"拉链，拉锁","explanation":"지퍼：拉链，拉锁；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지퍼","audio":"/audio/c4342c86c1b408c1389a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77807","senseId":"1","lemma":"지퍼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지퍼를","audio":"/audio/5829a98e764ada156db4.mp3"}},{"text":"잠그는","meaning":"拉上、扣合（拉链）","explanation":"잠그다 用于衣物的扣合；지퍼를 잠그다 是拉上拉链。","readings":[{"term":"잠그다","audio":"/audio/d96adf5b7c841e033ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24866","senseId":"3","lemma":"잠그다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠그는","audio":"/audio/6e5ada0fd55a96f28710.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"c4342c86c1b408c1","term":"지퍼","zh":"拉链，拉锁","audio":"/audio/c4342c86c1b408c1389a.mp3","entryId":"77807","definition":"在裤子、夹克、包等上安装各由一排金属齿或塑料齿组成的扣件，将两排齿拉入联锁位置使开口封闭。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d96adf5b7c841e03","term":"잠그다","zh":"拉上、扣合（拉链）","audio":"/audio/d96adf5b7c841e033ea3.mp3","entryId":"24866","definition":"拉上、扣合（拉链）","pronunciation":["잠그다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f9bbdb606e0598ecede.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77807-1-10-2","ko":"그래야겠다. 벌써 쌀쌀해졌어.","zh":"是该拉上了，天气已经变凉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래야겠다.","meaning":"那样做（指把拉链拉上）","explanation":"그러다：那样做（指把拉链拉上）；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래야겠다","audio":"/audio/d9293aeed2200636110b.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"쌀쌀해졌어.","meaning":"凉飕飕；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"쌀쌀하다：凉飕飕；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쌀쌀하다","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66104","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀쌀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌀쌀해졌어","audio":"/audio/f1256cd2ac2d84e99a87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样做（指把拉链拉上）","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"那样做（指把拉链拉上）","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"86c4cc835736d415","term":"쌀쌀하다","zh":"凉飕飕","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3","entryId":"66104","definition":"天气凉，感觉稍冷。","pronunciation":["쌀쌀하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c047d0752c73b7f28e51.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.396,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77807","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["说得对。已经变得很凉了。","天气这么冷，把拉链拉上怎么样？","你认识的那个人怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["天气这么冷，把拉链拉上怎么样？","你认识的那个人怎么样？","是该拉上了，天气已经变凉了。"],"answer":2}]}
